OL,3,GNEWSAMP welcomes new pregnancy loss
OL,4,Aleave rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP who campaigned for bereavement
OL,7,Fleave for people who have gone through
OL,8,Fan early miscarriage has welcomed news
OL,9,Ftheir grief will now be recognised.
OL,11,FSarah Owen, Labour MP for Luton North,
OL,12,Fhas herself suffered a miscarriage and
OL,13,Fsaid the "overwhelming sense" she felt
OL,14,Fafterwards was of grief and loss rather
OL,15,Fthan any physical issues.
OL,17,FThe new rights will also apply to
OL,18,Fparents who experience a miscarriage,
OL,19,Fterminations and unsuccessful IVF
OL,20,Fembryo transfers before 24 weeks of
OL,21,Fpregnancy.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
